==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} ''[[troposphère]]''.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|tropospheres}}

# The lower levels of the [[atmosphere]] extending from the surface of the [[Earth]] or another celestial body up to the [[tropopause]]. It is characterized by [[convection|convective]] air movements and a large vertical temperature change.

